00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.270
you all have your little neighborhoods.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:59.370
- Chicago is very provincial.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:00.930
People do know each other in Chicago.

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:02.490
It's a huge city, but it is weird.

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:03.323
So you were right.

00:04:03.323 --> 00:04:04.879
- Wasn't a weird thing to say, Ike.

00:04:04.879 --> 00:04:05.712
(laughs)

00:04:05.712 --> 00:04:08.313
It's like a metropolis.

